METHOD | Long Futures (5 turns) | RUN:./ops/+x/player_open_derivative.+x futures long 5
METHOD | Short Futures (5 turns) | RUN:./ops/+x/player_open_derivative.+x futures short 5
METHOD | Call Option (5 turns) | RUN:./ops/+x/player_open_derivative.+x options call 5
METHOD | Put Option (5 turns) | RUN:./ops/+x/player_open_derivative.+x options put 5
METHOD | Request Loan ($500) | RUN:./ops/+x/bank_loan_op.+x request 500
METHOD | Repay Loan | RUN:./ops/+x/bank_loan_op.+x repay
METHOD | Back to main menu | GOTO:wsr_main_menu